Your data source will be {!$EinsteinSearch:MutualFundData1_Retriever_1Cx_LfGae0a807e.results}

when user asks about some fund name, match it against scheme_name__c and if multiple matches, provide the list of funds with  scheme_name__c,risk_level__c  with donut char foem

for that please generate out put like below HTML
while generating please follow the below instruction too
instruction 1: Data labels will be scheme_name__c.
instruction 2: label: 'Fruit Count', data will be  risk_level__c
instruction 3: choose the backgroundColor accordingly
instruction 4: Please do not use \n in output
instruction 5: in side table tag  of html, Fund Name is mapped with scheme_name__c and  AMC mapped to amc_name__c , risk mapped risk_level__c and ratio mapped to expense_ratio__c



<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <title>Donut Chart with Summary Table</title>
 <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
 <style>
  body {
   font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
   text-align: center;
   padding: 20px;
  }

  #chartContainer {
   width: 400px;
   margin: auto;
  }

  canvas {
   width: 100% !important;
   height: auto !important;
  }

  table {
   width: 80%;
   margin: 30px auto;
   border-collapse: collapse;
  }

  table, th, td {
   border: 1px solid #ccc;
  }

  th, td {
   padding: 10px;
   text-align: left;
  }

  th {
   background-color: #f2f2f2;
  }
 </style>
</head>
<body>

 <h2>Fund Distribution - Donut Chart</h2>
 <div id="chartContainer">
  <canvas id="donutChart" width="400" height="400"></canvas>
 </div>

 <h3>Fund Summary</h3>
 <table>
  <thead>
   <tr>
    <th>Fund Name</th>
    <th>AMC</th>
    <th>Risk</th>
    <th>Ratio</th>
   </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <td>Kotak Equity Opportunities – Direct Growth</td>
    <td>Kotak</td>
    <td>Moderate</td>
    <td>6.0</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td>Kotak Tax Saver Fund</td>
    <td>Kotak</td>
    <td>High</td>
    <td>99</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td>Kotak Gold Fund</td>
    <td>Kotak</td>
    <td>Low</td>
    <td>5.0</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>

 <script>
  window.onload = function () {
   const ctx = document.getElementById('donutChart').getContext('2d');
   new Chart(ctx, {
    type: 'doughnut',
    data: {
     labels: [
      'Kotak Equity Opportunities – Direct Growth',
      'Kotak Tax Saver Fund',
      'Kotak Gold Fund'
     ],
     datasets: [{
      label: 'Fund Count',
      data: [6.0, 6.0, 5.0],
      backgroundColor: ['#FF6384', '#FFCE56', '#36A2EB'],
      borderWidth: 1
     }]
    },
    options: {
     plugins: {
      legend: {
       position: 'bottom'
      },
      tooltip: {
       callbacks: {
        label: function (context) {
         return `${context.label}: ${context.raw} count`;
        }
       }
      }
     },
     cutout: '60%' // Donut thickness
    }
   });
  };
 </script>

</body>
</html>

